        dat('the maidservant never pierced a DATA row (the_maidservant_never_pierced — 122:9; Kiddushin 15a, 17b: the DISAGREES row RESOLVED as data, the row stays OPEN in the readback as the design wrote it); the exam\'s person the master who pierces the maidservant — barred from it')
